{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include<bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong double absolute(long double a) {\n    return a < 0 ? -a : a;\n}\n\npair<int,int> best_fraction(int a, int b, int n) {\n    int best_num = 0, best_den = 0;\n    long double best_diff = 1e100;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        int x = i;\n        int y1 = (double)(a) / b * i;\n        int y0 = y1 + 1;\n        long double diff1 = absolute((long double)(a) / b - (long double)(y1) / x);\n        if (best_diff > diff1) {\n            best_num = y1;\n            best_den = x;\n            best_diff = diff1;\n        }\n        long double diff0 = absolute((long double)(a) / b - (long double)(y0) / x);\n        if (best_diff > diff0) {\n            best_num = y0;\n            best_den = x;\n            best_diff = diff0;\n        }\n    }\n    return {best_num, best_den};\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int a, b, n;\n    cin >> a >> b >> n;\n    auto res = best_fraction(a, b, n);\n    cout << res.first << \"/\" << res.second << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef absolute(a):\n    return -a if a < 0 else a\n\ndef best_fraction(a, b, n):\n    best_num = 0\n    best_den = 0\n    best_diff = 1e100\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        x = i\n        y1 = int(a / b * i)\n        y0 = y1 + 1\n        diff1 = absolute(a / b - y1 / x)\n        if best_diff > diff1:\n            best_num = y1\n            best_den = x\n            best_diff = diff1\n        diff0 = absolute(a / b - y0 / x)\n        if best_diff > diff0:\n            best_num = y0\n            best_den = x\n            best_diff = diff0\n    return best_num, best_den\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().strip().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    a, b, n = map(int, data[:3])\n    num, den = best_fraction(a, b, n)\n    print(f\"{num}/{den}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.014163684099912643, -0.25249505043029785, -1.1920858014491387e-05, -0.2528933584690094, -0.011017441749572754, -0.03816856071352959, -5.960462772236497e-07, -4.792098479811102e-05, -0.1698477417230606, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -9.60780744208023e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.6569954823353328e-05, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -0.00033682872890494764, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.410734163684538e-06, 0.0, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.008614521473646164, -0.008616885170340538, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, 0.0, -5.1616290875244886e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0011703077470883727, 0.0, 0.0, -1.4305104514278355e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -0.023246029391884804, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.00039498155820183456, -0.023605739697813988, 0.0, -0.02269299328327179, -3.8742269680369645e-